<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Belgo started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Belgo started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Fator Securities said it has started coverage of Brazilian steelmaker Cia. Siderurgica Belgo-Mineira with a speculative buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said the company has an attractive valuation based on EBITDA and cash flow if compared to other steel firms, but rumours of a takeover by steelmaker Mendes Junior poses high investment risk.</p>
<p>-- Belgo-Mineira preferred shares were down 0.78 percent at 89 reais at 1640 local/1340 EST on the Sao Paulo bourse.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
